<title>PHILIPPINES: Southeast Asia Cement 96 net 1.053 bln peso.</title>
<headline>Southeast Asia Cement 96 net 1.053 bln peso.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southeast Asia Cement Holdings Inc said on Tuesday its unaudited net income in 1996 reached 1.053 billion pesos, equivalent to an earnings per share of 0.207 pesos.</p>
</text>
